{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make pancakes on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook pancakes without burning them, then add fruits and sauces on top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRules\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make pancakes to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack them up high, then add scrumptious toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep cooking until time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Spread the batter on the pan and start cooking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Once one side is cooked, flip it over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Flip fully cooked pancakes onto a plate and start adding toppings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Add fruit on top! Choose from strawberries, nuts, bananas, blueberries, kiwi, and mango!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Drizzle on a sauce! Choose from chocolate sauce, cream, and honey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Once the pancakes are done, it's time to serve! The closer they match the order, the more points you get!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook up as many pancakes as possible and aim for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your pancake-making skills!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928650?t=1757546628","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3928650?t=1757546628","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor